135.3200000000000216 195.4900000000002365 Td
(The ILI9341 has no wired reset line, so a brief power/SPI glitch — most often when the NFC reader energises during) Tj
T* (a tag read on a marginal 5 V supply — can blank it while the ESP32 keeps running. Hit Reset display on the config) Tj
T* (page to recover without a reboot \(or power-cycle\). Mitigations in firmware: a conservative 40 MHz TFT clock, and the) Tj
T* (display repaint is held off while the NFC bus is actively reading so the two don't overlap. A solid 5 V supply / good) Tj
T* (cable is the real cure \(the CYD's USB VCC is often marginal\).) Tj
